{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/eudiwalletkit\/getstarted"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"article","title":"Get started","modules":[{"name":"EudiWalletKit"}],"roleHeading":"Article"},"abstract":[{"text":"How to install and initialize EUDI Wallet Kit in your project","type":"text"}],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/GetStarted","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Package-installation","text":"Package installation","type":"heading","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"To use EUDI Wallet Kit, add the following dependency to your Package.swift:","type":"text"}]},{"code":["dependencies: [","\t\t.package(url: \"https:\/\/github.com\/eu-digital-identity-wallet\/eudi-lib-ios-wallet-kit.git\", .upToNextMajor(from: \"0.6.6\"))","]"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Then add the Eudi Wallet package to your target’s dependencies:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["dependencies: [","\t\t.product(name: \"EudiWalletKit\", package: \"eudi-lib-ios-wallet-kit\"),","]"]},{"anchor":"Initialization","type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Initialization"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet"},{"type":"text","text":" class provides a unified API for the two user attestation presentation flows. It is initialized with a document storage manager instance. For SwiftUI apps, the wallet instance can be added as an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"environmentObject"},{"type":"text","text":" to be accessible from all views. A KeyChain implementation of document storage is available."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = EudiWalletConfiguration(serviceName: \"my_wallet_app\", logFileName: \"temp.txt\")","let trustConfig = TrustConfiguration(trustSource: .etsi(.eudiRef), fallbackTrustSource: nil)","let wallet = try! EudiWallet(eudiWalletConfig: config, trustConfig: trustConfig)","wallet.openID4VpConfig = OpenId4VpConfiguration(clientIdSchemes: [.x509SanDns, .x509Hash])","wallet.transactionLogger = MyFileTransactionLogger(wallet: wallet)","wallet.loadAllDocuments()"]},{"anchor":"Device-signature-algorithm","text":"Device signature algorithm","type":"heading","level":3},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Set ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWalletConfiguration\/deviceAlgorithm","isActive":true},{"text":" to select the COSE algorithm for mdoc device signatures in BLE and OpenID4VP presentations. It defaults to ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".es256"},{"type":"text","text":"; use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".esp256"},{"type":"text","text":" for fully specified P-256 signatures. Device MAC authentication ignores this setting."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = EudiWalletConfiguration(deviceAlgorithm: .esp256)"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"Transaction-logging","level":3,"text":"Transaction logging"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Implement "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TransactionLogger.log(transaction:)"},{"type":"text","text":" with "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TransactionEntry"},{"text":". Persist entries by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"transactionIdentifier","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":": subsequent calls update the same transaction. A request is saved with","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"transactionResult == .notCompleted"},{"type":"text","text":" before credential selection, and updated after successful"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"response delivery. Cancellation, failures, and interrupted sessions remain ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"NotCompleted"},{"text":".","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reasonOfNoncompletion"},{"text":" records a known reason.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Presentation ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"listOfClaimsRequested"},{"text":" includes the union of every DCQL credential\/claim alternative,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"including unavailable credential types and all ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vct_values"},{"text":". When claims are omitted, known paths","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from all matching wallet credentials are included. ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"listOfClaimsPresented"},{"text":" contains the disclosed","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"claim paths. Entries do not store claim values.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"BLE-Transfer-Mode","level":3,"text":"BLE Transfer Mode"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet\/bleTransferMode","isActive":true},{"text":" property controls the Bluetooth Low Energy role used during proximity (ISO 18013-5) presentation.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"You can set it during initialization via ","type":"text"},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWalletConfiguration\/bleTransferMode","isActive":true},{"text":" or update it later on the wallet instance:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".server","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":" (default): The holder device acts as a GATT peripheral (server), advertising and waiting for the reader to connect.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".client","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The holder device acts as a GATT central (client), scanning and connecting to the reader’s peripheral.","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".both","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"strong"},{"text":": The holder device supports both modes simultaneously and advertises both in the QR device engagement.","type":"text"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["let config = EudiWalletConfiguration(","    serviceName: \"my_wallet_app\",","    bleTransferMode: .server  \/\/ default; use .client or .both as needed",")","let trustConfig = TrustConfiguration(trustSource: .etsi(.eudiRef), fallbackTrustSource: nil)","let wallet = try! EudiWallet(eudiWalletConfig: config, trustConfig: trustConfig)","wallet.bleTransferMode = .client"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"BLE-Transport-Factory","level":3,"text":"BLE Transport Factory"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/EudiWallet\/bleTransportFactory","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" property lets you plug in a custom BLE transport implementation for proximity presentation. This enables alternative BLE communication channels (e.g., L2CAP or a custom BLE client mdoc transport) without modifying the library."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A transport factory conforms to the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"BleTransportFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol and provides "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createServer()"},{"type":"text","text":" and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"createClient()"},{"type":"text","text":" methods that each return an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"MdocBleTransport"},{"type":"text","text":" instance. When "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" (the default), "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DefaultBleTransportFactory"},{"type":"text","text":" is used, which creates the standard GATT server\/central transports."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Provide a custom factory at initialization","let config = EudiWalletConfiguration(","    serviceName: \"my_wallet_app\",","    bleTransferMode: .server,","    bleTransportFactory: MyCustomTransportFactory()",")","let trustConfig = TrustConfiguration(trustSource: .etsi(.eudiRef), fallbackTrustSource: nil)","let wallet = try! EudiWallet(eudiWalletConfig: config, trustConfig: trustConfig)"]},{"type":"heading","anchor":"OpenID4VCI-Configuration","level":3,"text":"OpenID4VCI Configuration"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The wallet now supports multiple OpenID4VCI issuer configurations for enhanced flexibility. You can configure the wallet with a dictionary of issuer configurations:"}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["\/\/ Configure multiple OpenID4VCI issuers with DPoP support","let issuerConfigurations: [String: OpenId4VciConfiguration] = [","    \"eudi_pid_issuer\": OpenId4VciConfiguration(","        credentialIssuerURL: \"https:\/\/pid.issuer.example.com\",","        keyAttestationsConfig: KeyAttestationConfiguration(walletAttestationsProvider: myWalletAttestationsProvider),","        requireDpop: true,","        issuerMetadataPolicy: .requireSigned(issuerTrust: issuerTrustAnchor),","        dpopKeyOptions: KeyOptions(","            secureAreaName: \"SecureEnclave\", curve: .P256, accessControl: .requireUserPresence","        )","    ),","    \"mdl_issuer\": OpenId4VciConfiguration(","        credentialIssuerURL: \"https:\/\/mdl.issuer.example.com\",","        keyAttestationsConfig: KeyAttestationConfiguration(walletAttestationsProvider: myWalletAttestationsProvider),","        requireDpop: false,","        issuerMetadataPolicy: .ignoreSigned","    )","]","","\/\/ Register additional issuers after initialization","try wallet.registerOpenId4VciServices(issuerConfigurations)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"issuerMetadataPolicy"},{"type":"text","text":" to control signed metadata handling per issuer:"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".requireSigned","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for issuers that require signed metadata validation","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":".ignoreSigned","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" for environments that still use unsigned metadata","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit"]]},"kind":"article","seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Essentials","generated":true,"anchor":"Essentials","identifiers":["doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/ManageDocuments","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/IssueDocuments","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/SecureAreas","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/PresentationService","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/TrustMark","doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/WalletUI"]}],"references":{"doc://EudiWalletKit/documentation/EudiWalletKit/RegistrationCertificate":{"url":"\/documentation\/eudiwalletkit\/registrationcertificate","kind":"article","abstract":[{"text":"Validate the Wallet-Relying Party Registration Certificate (WRPRC) that a relying party presents with a data-sharing request, or that a credential issuer publishes with its metadata.","type":"text"}],"title":"Registration Certificate","identifier":"doc:\/\/EudiWalletKit\/documentation\/EudiWalletKit\/RegistrationCertificate","role":"collectionGroup","type":"topic"},"doc://EudiWalletKit/documentation/EudiWalletKit/ManageDocuments":{"title":"Man